<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Cie Bancaire.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Cie Bancaire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 2.5 million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Compagnie Bancaire, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE  ISS PRICE  PREMIUM    GEARING     MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    500.00  11.30 FRF   8.50 PCT  5.0 TIMES   18.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL B    600.00  12.70 FRF  28.67 PCT  4.4 TIMES   18.DEC.00</p>
<p> PAYDATE	25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  565.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
